     5	    first and last digits of a number are odd (1, 3, 5, 7, 9).
     6	    For example:
     7	    specialFilter([15, -73, 14, -15]) => 1 
     8	    specialFilter([33, -2, -3, 45, 21, 109]) => 2
     9	    """
